# CODEOWNERS
#
# GitHub auto-requests review from these owners when a PR touches matching paths.
# One owner per area today (Ian). When new maintainers join, add them next to the
# area they own. Order matters: the last matching pattern wins, so more-specific
# patterns go below more-general ones.
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default: anything not matched below
*                               @iangoodnight

# Apps
/apps/api/                      @iangoodnight
/apps/web/                      @iangoodnight
/apps/cli/                      @iangoodnight

# Shared packages
/packages/api-types/            @iangoodnight

# Infrastructure and ops
/infra/                         @iangoodnight
/scripts/                       @iangoodnight
/.github/                       @iangoodnight

# Root tooling and contracts (anyone touching these is changing repo-wide rules)
/Taskfile.yml                   @iangoodnight
/tsconfig.base.json             @iangoodnight
/turbo.json                     @iangoodnight
/pnpm-workspace.yaml            @iangoodnight
/.commitlintrc.json             @iangoodnight
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @iangoodnight

# Documentation (durable, contributor-facing)
/README.md                      @iangoodnight
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @iangoodnight
/SECURITY.md                    @iangoodnight
/CHANGELOG.md                   @iangoodnight
/docs/                          @iangoodnight
